* lna-a5-commongate -> cascode topology (common-source + common-gate)
* Structural change: Add cascode transistor NM2 to form a cascode gain stage
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM1 n1 VIN1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM2 n2 VSS n1 VSS
L L2 VDD n2
C C2 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n3
NMOS NM3 n3 n3 VSS VSS
R R2 n3 n0
C Cbyp VIN1 VSS